WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:07.112
Scry Sync cannot read InDesign files, so
the row says Needs a PDF.

2
00:00:07.682 --> 00:00:11.402
Show in folder opens the synced folder in
Finder.

3
00:00:11.972 --> 00:00:16.588
In InDesign, export a PDF into this
folder.

4
00:00:17.158 --> 00:00:22.166
Scry Sync waits until the folder is quiet
for about a minute,

5
00:00:22.166 --> 00:00:24.957
then converts and sends each page.

6
00:00:25.527 --> 00:00:30.742
The InDesign row still says Needs a PDF,
and that is expected.
